---
// Format, convenience and cost compared with other options. Facts and features only, no claims
// about which works better. Sources are in the caption.
---
<section class="section section--mist" aria-labelledby="compare-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2 class="h2" id="compare-title">Why an at-home device</h2>
      <p>LaserTouchOne costs more than a basic TENS unit. Here’s what is different, side by side.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="compare-wrap" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-labelledby="compare-title">
      <table class="compare">
        <thead>
          <tr><th scope="col"><span class="sr">Feature</span></th><th scope="col" class="is-us">LaserTouchOne</th><th scope="col">A TENS-only unit</th><th scope="col">Repeated clinic visits</th></tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><th scope="row">Technology</th><td class="is-us" data-label="LaserTouchOne">Low-level laser and TENS in one head</td><td data-label="A TENS-only unit">TENS only</td><td data-label="Repeated clinic visits">Depends on the clinic</td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">Where</th><td class="is-us" data-label="LaserTouchOne">At home</td><td data-label="A TENS-only unit">At home</td><td data-label="Repeated clinic visits">At the clinic, plus travel</td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">Session</th><td class="is-us" data-label="LaserTouchOne">About 2 minutes per area</td><td data-label="A TENS-only unit">Commonly up to 15 minutes</td><td data-label="Repeated clinic visits">An appointment</td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">Prescription</th><td class="is-us" data-label="LaserTouchOne">No, over the counter</td><td data-label="A TENS-only unit">Usually no</td><td data-label="Repeated clinic visits">May need a referral</td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">Supplies</th><td class="is-us" data-label="LaserTouchOne">Electrode gel; no stick-on pads</td><td data-label="A TENS-only unit">Stick-on pads that need replacing</td><td data-label="Repeated clinic visits">None</td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">Cost</th><td class="is-us" data-label="LaserTouchOne">$550 once</td><td data-label="A TENS-only unit">About $45 to $90, plus pads</td><td data-label="Repeated clinic visits">A fee every visit</td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">Guarantee</th><td class="is-us" data-label="LaserTouchOne">Manufacturer’s money-back guarantee</td><td data-label="A TENS-only unit">Varies by brand</td><td data-label="Repeated clinic visits">Not applicable</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
      <p class="small muted" style="margin-top:var(--s2)">This compares format and cost, not results. TENS-only prices and session length are from published retail listings, for example the OMRON Max Power Relief (MSRP $79.99, sessions up to 15 minutes), November 2026.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
